ket":{"draft_en":"On February 18, 2024, the Texas state monitor at HRM-7 W Baytown recorded 15.37 ppb of 1,3-butadiene in the 8:00 p.m. CST hour, against a 7-day median of 0.135 ppb. Wind there came from 17 degrees at 4.4 mph. 12 major permitted facilities lie in the upwind corridor. No matching report found in a complete search of that day's emissions-event records for Harris County. That does not show who or what caused the reading. Requested follow-up: confirm whether any facility in this corridor reported a release that hour.","draft_es":"El 18 de febrero de 2024, el monitor estatal de Texas en HRM-7 W Baytown registró 15.37 ppb de 1,3-butadieno en la hora de las 8:00 p. m. CST, frente a una mediana de 7 días de 0.135 ppb. El viento venía de 17 grados a 4.4 mph. Hay 12 instalaciones grandes con permiso en el corredor viento arriba. No se encontró un reporte que coincida en una búsqueda completa de los registros de eventos de emisiones de ese día en el condado de Harris. Eso no indica quién o qué causó la lectura. Seguimiento solicitado: confirmar si alguna instalación en este corredor reportó una emisión a esa hora.","drafted_by":"template (deterministic, no AI)","guard":{"passed":true,"rejected":[]}},"cannot_say":["A matching report is not proof the facility caused every reading; other sources can add to a spike.","'Not yet reported' is not a finding about any facility: Texas requires a report only at or above a reportable quantity, and air readings cannot measure how much was released (30 TAC 101.201).","The upwind corridor comes from wind direction at one monitor (geometry only), not a dispersion model; it cannot tell facilities along the same bearing apart.","Facility coordinates are as published by EPA ECHO and may be approximate.","Only regulator-grade monitors whose data the state publishes are used, never low-cost sensors."],"provenance":[{"file":"region_baytown/agc_2024_48_201_0807_43218.html","url":"https://www.tceq.texas.gov/cgi-bin/compliance/monops/